# =============================================================================
# 07b_lab_restore.rman - Migration phase M.1, step 7b (called by 07_lab_restore.sql)
# Restores and recovers the lab tablespace, then deletes the backups that are
# no longer wanted: the lab backup and the unencrypted cold backup of step 3
# (the validated encrypted level 0 of step 6b replaces it).
# Arguments (RMAN USING): &1 = PDB, &2 = lab tablespace (from 00_config.sql)
#
# Author: Natalia Müller
# Copyright (c) 2026 Natalia Müller. All rights reserved.
# Since:  2026-10-12
# =============================================================================

RESTORE TABLESPACE &1.:&2.;
RECOVER TABLESPACE &1.:&2.;

DELETE NOPROMPT BACKUP TAG 'LAB';
DELETE NOPROMPT BACKUP TAG 'COLD_NOARCHIVELOG';
LIST BACKUP SUMMARY;
